From 75337e3d49a702ca7c93bef211b43ad93ea3227f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Trotter <james@jamesat.dev>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:54:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] api: network channels (channel_ensure, channel_drop) and
 sajoin by nick

POST /v1/channel_ensure creates a channel with no members if needed and
registers it to a founder account unless it is already registered (never
taking one over), optionally setting its topic. POST /v1/channel_drop
unregisters such a channel. POST /v1/sajoin also takes a nick, to join
one client (e.g. a guest) instead of an account's clients. Lets an
external system keep fixed, owner-founded channels and auto-join new
users without parsing IRC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
